// QR for https://tinyurl.com/trailmstr — the cloud PWA.
//
// Shown on the device once Wi-Fi is provisioned, so the phone can reach the app
// by camera from a normal browser. That sidesteps the whole captive-portal
// problem: the phone is off the board's AP by then, so there is no hijacking
// DNS in the path and no OS portal window to escape from.
//
// 37 modules at 7px including a 4-module quiet zone. Draw at NATIVE SIZE —
// resampling a bitmap QR by a non-integer factor smears the module edges until a
// camera cannot resolve them. Regenerate rather than scale. Byte format is
// LVGL INDEXED_1BIT: 8-byte palette then 33-byte rows, set bit = dark module.
